    {"id":"lark-zh_0","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-zh","file_name":"潮汐站主册.pdf","page_number":1,"content":"青鹭潮汐站现行夜间水位监测规程生效于春季。低潮报警后，应在 26 分钟内进行第一次现场复核。"},
    {"id":"lark-zh_1","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-zh","file_name":"潮汐站主册.pdf","page_number":2,"content":"上年度备选规程曾要求低潮报警后 62 分钟内复核，现已失效。"},
    {"id":"lark-zh_2","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-zh","file_name":"潮汐站主册.pdf","page_number":3,"content":"春季低潮报警工单使用工单代码 TIDE-CHECK。报警参照铭牌写有 TIDE-REF。"},
    {"id":"lark-zh_3","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-zh","file_name":"潮汐站主册.pdf","page_number":4,"content":"现行手册没有规定仪器更换后的具体保修时长。"},
    {"id":"lark-zh_4","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-zh","file_name":"潮汐站主册.pdf","page_number":5,"content":"港内标识牌为 HARBOR-SIGN。它用于标注通行方向。"},
    {"id":"lark-extra-zh_0","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-extra-zh","file_name":"潮汐站附册.pdf","page_number":1,"content":"青鹭潮汐站春季低潮现场复核完成后，电子记录签收用表格 TIDE-ACK。"},
    {"id":"lark-extra-zh_1","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-extra-zh","file_name":"潮汐站附册.pdf","page_number":2,"content":"TIDE-OLD 是上年度现场记录表。新版表格生效后停用。"},
    {"id":"lark-extra-zh_2","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-extra-zh","file_name":"潮汐站附册.pdf","page_number":3,"content":"测量仪器校准记录每年复查。更换仪器需保留当次施工记录。"},
    {"id":"lark-extra-zh_3","namespace":"adaptive-zh","document_id":"lark-extra-zh","file_name":"潮汐站附册.pdf","page_number":4,"content":"港内通行签到时使用访客通行核验码 TIDE-GATE。通行核验与水位报警是两个流程。"},
